# Uncaptured normal app cadence: 30 seconds of walking to and fro in the tavern lane.
# Requires OPENGOTHIC_ENABLE_APP_CADENCE=ON in CMake. Do not use video FPS as game FPS.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
movable on
off: character off
on: character on
character route tavern
walkmode walk
view nopfx
overlay off
wait 1500
cadence normal
wait 34
off: character measure off
on: character measure on
hold forward 40000
cadence wait
release all
character report
